## Step 4 — Measurement report

After all tests run, create e2e/report.ts that:

1. Reads Playwright JSON results
2. Outputs a markdown report: e2e/EVAL_REPORT.md

Report must include these sections:

### Animation quality
- Cursor flight: pass/fail
- Arrival bob: pass/fail
- Reduced-motion skip: pass/fail
- Fade after inactivity: pass/fail

### Target lock accuracy
